#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-copy.md:6
msgid "Name"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-copy.md:8
msgid "`nix copy` - copy paths between Nix stores"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-copy.md:10
msgid "Synopsis"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-copy.md:12
msgid "`nix copy` \\[_option_...\\] _installables_..."
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-copy.md:14
msgid "Examples"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-copy.md:16
msgid "Copy Firefox from the local store to a binary cache in `/tmp/cache`:"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-copy.md:18
msgid ""
"```console\n"
"# nix copy --to file:///tmp/cache $(type -p firefox)\n"
"```"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-copy.md:22
msgid ""
"Note the `file://` - without this, the destination is a chroot store, not a "
"binary cache."
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-copy.md:25
msgid ""
"Copy all store paths from a local binary cache in `/tmp/cache` to the local "
"store:"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-copy.md:27
msgid ""
"```console\n"
"# nix copy --all --from file:///tmp/cache\n"
"```"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-copy.md:31
msgid ""
"Copy the entire current NixOS system closure to another machine via SSH:"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-copy.md:34
msgid ""
"```console\n"
"# nix copy --substitute-on-destination --to ssh://server /run/current-"
"system\n"
"```"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-copy.md:38
msgid ""
"The `-s` flag causes the remote machine to try to substitute missing store "
"paths, which may be faster if the link between the local and remote machines "
"is slower than the link between the remote machine and its substituters (e."
"g. `https://cache.nixos.org`)."
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-copy.md:43
msgid "Copy a closure from another machine via SSH:"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-copy.md:45
msgid ""
"```console\n"
"# nix copy --from ssh://server /nix/store/a6cnl93nk1wxnq84brbbwr6hxw9gp2w9-"
"blender-2.79-rc2\n"
"```"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-copy.md:49
msgid "Copy Hello to a binary cache in an Amazon S3 bucket:"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-copy.md:51
msgid ""
"```console\n"
"# nix copy --to s3://my-bucket?region=eu-west-1 nixpkgs#hello\n"
"```"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-copy.md:55
msgid "or to an S3-compatible storage system:"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-copy.md:57
msgid ""
"```console\n"
"# nix copy --to s3://my-bucket?region=eu-west-1&endpoint=example.com "
"nixpkgs#hello\n"
"```"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-copy.md:61
msgid "Note that this only works if Nix is built with AWS support."
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-copy.md:63
msgid ""
"Copy a closure from `/nix/store` to the chroot store `/tmp/nix/nix/store`:"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-copy.md:69
msgid ""
"Update the NixOS system profile to point to a closure copied from a remote "
"machine:"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-copy.md:72
msgid ""
"```console\n"
"# nix copy --from ssh://server \\\n"
"    --profile /nix/var/nix/profiles/system \\\n"
"    /nix/store/r14v3km89zm3prwsa521fab5kgzvfbw4-nixos-system-"
"foobar-24.05.20240925.759537f\n"
"```"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-copy.md:78
msgid "Description"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-copy.md:80
msgid ""
"`nix copy` copies store path closures between two Nix stores. The source "
"store is specified using `--from` and the destination using `--to`. If one "
"of these is omitted, it defaults to the local store."
msgstr ""

